WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.200
Choose the sentence you hear. The options change only one or two words.

2
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:14.800
“work at home” changes the verb and the place. “never” says the opposite of usually.

3
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:23.500
You hear “I usually walk to work”: walk means to go on foot and sounds different from work.
